    from this card, then target 1 monster on the field whose current ATK or DEF is
    different from its original value; its ATK/DEF become their original values,
    also if you targeted a monster on your field, it cannot be destroyed by battle
    or card effects this turn. Once per turn, if another monster(s) is Special Summoned
    to your field and this card has 3 or more materials (except during the Damage
    Step): You can make that monster(s) gain 900 ATK.'
